adges for each member\n- Handles empty state\n- Updates list after inviting\n- Updates list after removing\n\n#### b) `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/members-invite.spec.ts`\nTests for the invite modal:\n- Opens invite modal from button\n- Validates email format\n- Handles empty email field\n- Rejects already-existing emails\n- Allows cancellation\n- Supports backdrop click to close\n- Supports Enter key submission\n- Can be opened multiple times cleanly\n\n#### c) `/repo/apps/LinearClone/tests/members-actions.spec.ts`\nTests for member role and removal actions:\n- Changes member role from Member to Admin\n- Changes member role from Admin to Member\n- Shows role dropdown with available roles\n- Displays active role with checkmark\n- Prevents demotion of last admin\n- Shows removal confirmation dialog\n- Cannot remove yourself\n\n---\n\n### 4. MEMBER-RELATED COMPONENTS\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/`\n\n#### a) **MemberList.tsx** (109 lines)\nMain member list display component.\n\n**Props**:\n```typescript\ninterface MemberListProps {\n  members: Member[];\n  currentUserId: string | null;\n  adminCount: number;\n  onChangeRole: (memberId: string, role: string) => Promise<void>;\n  onRemove: (memberId: string) => Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n**Key TestIDs**:\n- `member-list` - Container for all members\n- `member-list-empty` - Empty state container\n- `member-row-${member.id}` - Individual member row\n- `member-avatar-${member.id}` - Avatar with initials (e.g., \"AJ\" for Alice Johnson)\n- `member-name-${member.id}` - Member name text\n- `member-email-${member.id}` - Member email text\n- `member-role-badge-${member.id}` - Role badge (Admin/Member)\n- `member-teams-${member.id}` - Teams container\n- `member-team-badge-${member.id}-${team.id}` - Individual team badge\n\n**CSS Classes**:\n- `.member-list` - List container\n- `.member-row` - Member row\n- `.member-avatar` - Avatar element\n- `.member-role-badge` - Role badge\n- `.member-role-badge-admin` - Admin role styling\n- `.member-role-badge-member` - Member role styling\n- `.member-team-badge` - Team badge styling\n\n#### b) **MemberActions.tsx** (151 lines)\nDropdown and removal controls for members.\n\n**Props**:\n```typescript\ninterface MemberActionsProps {\n  member: Member;\n  isSelf: boolean;\n  isLastAdmin: boolean;\n  onChangeRole: (memberId: string, role: string) => Promise<void>;\n  onRemove: (memberId: string) => Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n**Key TestIDs**:\n- `member-actions-${member.id}` - Main actions container\n- `member-role-dropdown-btn-${member.id}` - Dropdown button\n- `member-role-dropdown-${member.id}` - Dropdown menu container\n- `member-role-option-admin-${member.id}` - Admin option in dropdown\n- `member-role-option-member-${member.id}` - Member option in dropdown\n- `member-remove-btn-${member.id}` - Remove button\n- `member-remove-confirm-overlay-${member.id}` - Confirmation dialog overlay\n- `member-remove-confirm-dialog-${member.id}` - Confirmation dialog\n- `member-remove-confirm-btn-${member.id}` - Confirm removal button\n- `member-remove-confirm-cancel-${member.id}` - Cancel button\n\n**CSS Classes**:\n- `.member-actions-role-wrapper` - Wrapper for role dropdown\n- `.member-actions-role-btn` - Dropdown button\n- `.member-actions-role-dropdown` - Dropdown menu\n- `.member-actions-role-option` - Role option\n- `.member-actions-role-option-active` - Active role option (with checkmark)\n- `.member-actions-remove-btn` - Remove button\n- `.member-actions-confirm-overlay` - Confirmation overlay\n- `.member-actions-confirm-dialog` - Confirmation dialog\n- `.member-actions-confirm-buttons` - Button container\n- `.member-actions-confirm-remove` - Remove confirmation button\n\n#### c) **InviteMemberModal.tsx** (137 lines)\nModal for inviting new members.\n\n**Props**:\n```typescript\ninterface InviteMemberModalProps {\n  open: boolean;\n  onClose: () => void;\n  onSubmit: (email: string) => Promise<void>;\n}\n```\n\n**Key TestIDs**:\n- `invite-member-modal-overlay` - Modal overlay/backdrop\n- `invite-member-modal` - Modal container\n- `invite-member-email-field` - Email field wrapper\n- `invite-member-email-input` - Email input field\n- `invite-member-error` - Error message display\n- `invite-member-submit-btn` - Send Invite button\n- `invite-member-cancel-btn` - Cancel button\n\n**CSS Classes**:\n- `.invite-member-overlay` - Overlay container\n- `.invite-member-modal` - Modal container\n- `.imm-header` - Modal header\n- `.imm-title` - Title text\n- `.imm-body` - Modal body\n- `.imm-field` - Field wrapper\n- `.imm-label` - Label text\n- `.imm-input` - Input field\n- `.imm-input-error` - Error state styling\n- `.imm-error` - Error message\n- `.imm-footer` - Modal footer\n- `.imm-cancel-btn` - Cancel button\n- `.imm-submit-btn` - Submit button\n\n#### d) **Members.tsx (Members Page)** (79 lines)\nMain members page component.\n\n**Key TestIDs**:\n- `members-page` - Main page container\n- `members-title` - Page title (\"Members\")\n- `invite-member-btn` - Invite Member button\n- `member-list` - Member list (delegates to MemberList)\n- `members-loading` - Loading state container\n\n---\n\n### 5. REDUX STATE MANAGEMENT\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/slices/membersSlice.ts`\n\n**Member Interface**:\n```typescript\nexport interface Member {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n  email: string;\n  role: string; // 'admin' | 'member'\n  teams: MemberTeam[];\n}\n\nexport interface MemberTeam {\n  id: string;\n  name: string;\n}\n```\n\n**Redux Async Thunks (API calls)**:\n\n1. **fetchMembers**: GET `/api/members`\n   - Returns: `{ members: Member[]; currentUserId: string }`\n   - Used on page load to populate members list\n\n2. **inviteMember**: POST `/api/members`\n   - Payload: `{ email: string }`\n   - Returns: `{ member: Member }`\n   - Validates email format before sending\n   - Handles duplicate email rejection\n\n3. **updateMemberRole**: PUT `/api/members/${memberId}`\n   - Payload: `{ role: 'admin' | 'member' }`\n   - Returns: `{ memberId, role }`\n   - Prevents demotion of last admin\n\n4. **removeMember**: DELETE `/api/members/${memberId}`\n   - Returns: `{ memberId }`\n   - Cannot remove yourself\n   - Cascades deletion from team_members and sessions\n\n---\n\n### 6. NETLIFY API FUNCTIONS\n\n**Location**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n#### a) **members.ts** (205 lines)\nMain member management endpoint.\n\n**Endpoints**:\n\n| Method | Path | Purpose | Auth | Status |\n|--------|------|---------|------|--------|\n| GET | `/api/members` | List all members with teams | Bearer | 200 |\n| POST | `/api/members` | Invite new member | Bearer | 201 |\n| PUT | `/api/members/{memberId}` | Update member role | Bearer | 200 |\n| DELETE | `/api/members/{memberId}` | Remove member | Bearer | 200 |\n\n**POST /api/members** (Invite):\n- Required: `email` (string)\n- Validates email format regex: `/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/`\n- Checks for duplicate emails (returns 409 conflict)\n- Creates member with temporary password \"temporary123\"\n- Default role: \"member\"\n- Default teams: [] (empty)\n\n**PUT /api/members/{memberId}** (Update Role):\n- Required: `role` (\"admin\" | \"member\")\n- Validates role is one of the two allowed values\n- Prevents demotion of last admin (returns 400)\n- Updates member.role in database\n\n**DELETE /api/members/{memberId}** (Remove):\n- Prevents self-deletion (returns 400)\n- Deletes from team_members (cascading)\n- Deletes sessions (force logout)\n- Deletes member record\n\n#### b) **team-members.ts** (100 lines)\nTeam membership management endpoint.\n\n**Endpoints**:\n\n| Method | Path | Purpose | Auth | Status |\n|--------|------|---------|------|--------|\n| POST | `/api/team-members` | Add member to team | Bearer | 201 |\n| DELETE | `/api/team-members` | Remove member from team | Bearer | 200 |\n\n**POST** (Add to team):\n- Required: `teamId`, `memberIdToAdd`\n- Checks if already on team (returns 409 conflict)\n- Inserts into team_members table\n\n**DELETE** (Remove from team):\n- Required: `teamId`, `memberIdToRemove`\n- Removes from team_members table\n- Member remains in workspace\n\n---\n\n### 7. SEED DATA\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/scripts/seed-db.ts` (150+ lines)\n\n**Default Seeded Members**:\n\n```typescript\n// Alice Johnson\n{\n  id: auto-generated UUID,\n  name: 'Alice Johnson',\n  email: 'alice@acme.com',\n  password: 'password123',\n  role: 'admin',\n  teams: ['Engineering', 'Design']\n}\n\n// Bob Smith\n{\n  id: auto-generated UUID,\n  name: 'Bob Smith',\n  email: 'bob@acme.com',\n  password: 'password123',\n  role: 'member',\n  teams: ['Engineering']\n}\n\n// Carol Davis\n{\n  id: auto-generated UUID,\n  name: 'Carol Davis',\n  email: 'carol@acme.com',\n  password: 'password123',\n  role: 'member',\n  teams: ['Engineering', 'Design']\n}\n```\n\n**Default Teams**:\n- Engineering (ENG, 3 members: Alice, Bob, Carol)\n- Design (DES, 2 members: Alice, Carol)\n\n**Login Credentials for Testing**:\n- Email: `alice@acme.com`, Password: `password123` (Admin)\n- Email: `bob@acme.com`, Password: `password123` (Member)\n- Email: `carol@acme.com`, Password: `password123` (Member)\n\n---\n\n### 8. PLAYWRIGHT CONFIGURATION\n\n**File**: `/repo/apps/LinearClone/playwright.config.ts`\n\n```typescript\nexport default defineConfig({\n  testDir: './tests',\n  timeout: 60000,\n  expect: {\n    timeout: 10000,\n  },\n  fullyParallel: true,\n  forbidOnly: true,\n  retries: 0,\n  reporter: [\n    replayReporter({ upload: false }),\n    ['json', { outputFile: 'test-results/results.json' }],\n    ['html', { open: 'never' }],\n  ],\n  use: {\n    ...replayDevices['Replay Chromium'],\n    baseURL: 'http://localhost:8888',\n    actionTimeout: 15000,\n  },\n});\n```\n\n**Key Details**:\n- Test timeout: 60 seconds\n- Assertion timeout: 10 seconds\n- Base URL: `http://localhost:8888`\n- Action timeout: 15 seconds\n- No retries by default\n- Replay.io integration for debugging\n- Parallel execution enabled\n- Reports: JSON, HTML, and Replay\n\n**Test Runner Command**: `npm test` (via `tsx scripts/test.ts`)\n\n---\n\n### 9. COMPLETE TEST ID REFERENCE\n\n#### Members List\n- `members-page`\n- `members-title`\n- `invite-member-btn`\n- `member-list`\n- `member-list-empty`\n- `member-row-${id}`\n- `member-avatar-${id}`\n- `member-name-${id}`\n- `member-email-${id}`\n- `member-role-badge-${id}`\n- `member-teams-${id}`\n- `member-team-badge-${id}-${teamId}`\n\n#### Member Actions\n- `member-actions-${id}`\n- `member-role-dropdown-btn-${id}`\n- `member-role-dropdown-${id}`\n- `member-role-option-admin-${id}`\n- `member-role-option-member-${id}`\n- `member-remove-btn-${id}`\n- `member-remove-confirm-overlay-${id}`\n- `member-remove-confirm-dialog-${id}`\n- `member-remove-confirm-btn-${id}`\n- `member-remove-confirm-cancel-${id}`\n\n#### Invite Modal\n- `invite-member-modal-overlay`\n- `invite-member-modal`\n- `invite-member-email-field`\n- `invite-member-email-input`\n- `invite-member-error`\n- `invite-member-submit-btn`\n- `invite-member-cancel-btn`\n\n#### Page Level\n- `members-page`\n- `members-loading`\n\n---\n\n### 10. KEY API INTEGRATION PATTERNS\n\n**Authentication**: All API calls include Bearer token in Authorization header\n```\nAuthorization: Bearer {token}\nContent-Type: application/json\n```\n\n**Error Handling**:\n- Invalid email format: \"Please enter a valid email address\"\n- Empty email: \"Email is required\"\n- Duplicate member: \"This email is already a member of the workspace\"\n- Last admin demotion: \"Cannot demote the last Admin\"\n- Self-removal: \"Cannot remove yourself\"\n\n**Client-Side Validation** (InviteMemberModal):\n- Email regex: `/^[^\\s@]+@[^\\s@]+\\.[^\\s@]+$/`\n- Trim whitespace\n- Required field check\n\n---\n\n### 11. FILE PATHS SUMMARY\n\n| Component | Path |\n|-----------|------|\n| Members Page | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/pages/Members.tsx` |\n| MemberList | `/repo/apps/LinearClone/src/components/MemberList